[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19205.83, "timestamp": "05:20:05", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19211.35, "timestamp": "05:20:11", "text": "不知道該怎麼解釋，但他們之間的互動就不像以前那麼多了。啊，有些人把這看作是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19213.59, "timestamp": "05:20:13", "text": "一種超驗的事物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19215.91, "timestamp": "05:20:15", "text": "。裡。 嗯，這也是我之前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19225.67, "timestamp": "05:20:25", "text": "聯繫一些人時所擔心的。是的。 「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19252.35, "timestamp": "05:20:52", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19256.55, "timestamp": "05:20:56", "text": "你好，Zafras。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19258.55, "timestamp": "05:20:58", "text": "你好。如何進入？我之所以這麼問，是因為我現在已經對"}]